WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Twenty minutes to kick-off.

2
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:10.400
A fan is at your gate with a ticket for the other side of the stadium.

3
00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:16.200
He speaks a little English, and he's worried he'll miss the start.

4
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.100
Over to you.

